        "review": "The hosted strict ARM64 scan reported one HIGH finding for each installed OpenSSL runtime package. During the one-time derivative bootstrap, this signed digest may be used only as the derivative build input and as the isolated synthetic database-test fixture on a native ARM64 runner; it is prohibited from beta deployment. The container workflow must install the exact fixed packages and scan the final derivative with an explicit empty ignore policy before creating its deployable immutable tag. Once that tag exists, the CI fixture must move to the exact repository derivative digest and this exception must be removed."
